    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "show_title": true,
        "title": "Steps B4, C and D3: consoles call bpm through the gateway (RUM, every environment)",
        "background_color": "vivid_yellow",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "note",
              "content": "**What proves it.** RUM records every `/bpm/*` call the three consoles make and the host they send it to. The `microservices.*` hosts must fall to zero and `gateway.*` must take over: SIT first (`\u2026 Platform Test` applications on `microservices-private.sit\u2026`), then UAT (`microservices.uat\u2026`), then prod (`\u2026 Platform Prod` on `microservices.prod\u2026`). Pick the environment with the `env`-less application names in the legend.\n\n**bpm-service 10562 (engine identity on the REST API)** has no traffic signature of its own; its check is the table on the PR. The last widget counts Camunda authorization denials in the bpm logs, which only exist once the filter is live: a few are expected (callers without grants), a flood means a legitimate caller lost its grants.",
              "background_color": "gray",
              "font_size": "14",
              "text_align": "left",
              "has_padding": true,
              "show_tick": false
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Consoles: /bpm calls by destination host (all environments)",
              "title_align": "left",
              "title_size": "16",
              "show_legend": true,
              "legend_layout": "auto",
              "legend_columns": [
                "avg",
                "max",
                "value"
              ],
              "requests": [
                {
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "dog_classic",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "rum",
                      "name": "r",
                      "search": {
                        "query": "@type:resource @resource.url_path:\\/bpm\\/*"
                      },
                      "compute": {
                        "aggregation": "count"
                      },
                      "group_by": [
                        {
                          "facet": "@resource.url_host",
                          "limit": 10,
                          "sort": {
                            "aggregation": "count",
                            "order": "desc"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "r"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "timeseries",
              "title": "Consoles still calling bpm directly, per console application",
              "title_align": "left",
              "title_size": "16",
              "show_legend": true,
              "legend_layout": "auto",
              "legend_columns": [
                "avg",
                "max",
                "value"
              ],
              "requests": [
                {
                  "display_type": "bars",
                  "response_format": "timeseries",
                  "style": {
                    "palette": "warm",
                    "line_type": "solid",
                    "line_width": "normal"
                  },
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "data_source": "rum",
                      "name": "r",
                      "search": {
